## Certificates
## The dev/test mTLS certs under certs/ (ca.*, client.*, untrusted-client.*) are
## intentionally committed - they're throwaway, clearly-fake, dev-only certs that
## let the repo run mTLS demos with zero setup. Never put real certs there; if you
## ever do, ignore them locally instead of changing this rule.

